[00:00.00] 作词 : David Gilmour
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : David Gilmour
[01:36.73]You shout in your sleep.
[01:36.73]睡梦中你大声呼喊
[01:39.82]Perhaps the price is just too steep.
[01:39.82]可能是因为代价过高
[01:43.63]Is your conscience at rest
[01:43.63]你的良知也睡着了吗
[01:47.54]If once put to the test?
[01:47.54]还是只为了接受考验
[01:51.37]You awake with a start
[01:51.37]你突然惊醒
[01:55.04]To just the beating of your heart.
[01:55.04]心扑通一阵狂跳
[01:58.99]Just one man beneath the sky,
[01:58.99]只有你一个人站在天底下
[02:02.71]Just two ears, just two eyes.
[02:02.71]还是两个耳朵和两只眼睛
[02:14.34]You set sail across the sea
[02:14.34]你扬帆穿过大海
[02:18.09]Of long past thoughts and memories.
[02:18.09]海上漂浮着永恒的思想和记忆
[02:21.87]Childhood's end, your fantasies
[02:21.87]孩提时代已经结束 你的奇思妙想
[02:25.57]Merge with harsh realities.
[02:25.57]熔铸进残酷的现实
[02:26.94]
[02:29.60]And then as the sail is hoist,
[02:29.60]然后挂满帆吧
[02:33.14]You find your eyes are growing moist.
[02:33.14]你才发现你眼中饱含泪水
[02:37.18]All the fears never voiced
[02:37.18]寂静无声的恐惧
[02:40.85]Say you have to make your final choice.
[02:40.85]向你诉说你必须作出最后抉择
[03:27.25]Who are you and who am I
[03:27.25]你是谁 我又是谁呢
[03:30.64]To say we know the reason why?
[03:30.64]只是为了弄清这个原因
[03:34.47]Some are born; some men die
[03:34.47]有些人出生 有些人死去
[03:38.24]Beneath one infinite sky.
[03:38.24]全都在这片无尽的天穹下
[03:42.22]There'll be war, there'll be peace.
[03:42.22]总有战争与和平
[03:45.92]But everything one day will cease.
[03:45.92]但有一天一切都会终结
[03:49.81]All the iron turned to rust;
[03:49.81]所有的钢铁爬满红锈
[03:53.61]All the proud men turned to dust.
[03:53.61]所有趾高气扬之人化作尘埃
[03:57.43]And so all things, time will mend.
[03:57.43]所以万事万物啊 时间都会将之修整
[04:02.13]So this song will end.
[04:02.13]而这首歌也会戛然而止
